      "description": "Watch Racing Club vs Boca Juniors highlights and goals from Argentine Primera División on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 24, 2026. A Battle Under the Lights On August 24, 2026, Racing Club and Boca Juniors faced off in a high-stakes Liga Profesional Argentina match, characterized by heavy challenges and significant tactical maneuvering. The stadium atmosphere was electric as both sides looked to establish dominance in a fixture that promised plenty of drama. Fast-Paced First Half Matches in this competition are rarely quiet, and this one was no exception. By the 5th minute, Ayrton Costa had already picked up a yellow card, setting the tone for a physical encounter. The deadlock was broken in the 9th minute when Marcos Rojo coolly converted a penalty to put Racing Club ahead. The lead was short-lived, however, as Miguel Merentiel leveled the score in the 28th minute, clinically finishing off an assist from Leonel Flores . Tactical Struggles The second half saw both managers turn to their benches to find a winning edge. A flurry of substitutions, including the introduction of Enner Valencia , Alan Velasco , and Sebastian Villa , signaled the desperate search for a late goal. Despite the tactical adjustments and persistent pressure, the defensive structures held firm. As the referee brandished yellow cards to Ezequiel Cannavo , Tomas Belmonte , and Leonel Perez in the closing stages, it became clear that neither side would break the impasse, with the final whistle blowing at 90+6 minutes."
